    [project] => World Food LCA database (WFLDB)
    [lci_method] => WFLDB Methodological Guidelines for the Life Cycle Inventory of Agricultural Products
    [ds_data_selection] => The aim of the WFLDB project was to cover for each product at least 50% of the global export market.
    [ds_data_treatment] => Data were categorised from level 0 (LO) to level (L4) based on their source and detail. Land use change (LUC) combines land transformation areas calculated with the adapted 'Direct Land Use Change Assessment Tool' version 2014 and carbon losses from soil organic carbon (SOC) and vegetation (VEG) as calculated in ecoinvent v3.
    [data_collection_period] => 2009-2012
    [ds_data_completeness] => The dataset includes all activities from nursery production of seedlings to waste treatment after orchard clearing. This includes establishment phase (tree nursery, soil cultivation, planting, irrigation) and productive phase (machine operations, infrastructure, fuel use, soil cultivation, fertiliser and pesticide application, harvesting, irrigation). Direct field emissions and land use change are included. Heavy metal uptake by the crop is considered. Inputs of seedlings, fertilisers, pesticides, and their packaging are considered. The dataset does not include emissions from manure storage.
    [completeness_text] => PEF-Quality: data quality rating (DQR) = 3.2 (i.e. fair quality).
    [sources_text] => Ozkan B., Akcoaz H., Karadeniz F. (2004). Energy requirement and economic analysis of citrus production in Turkey. Energy Conversion and Management, 45. | EEA (2013). EMEP/EEA air pollutant emission inventory guidebook 2013 - Technical guidance to prepare national emission inventories. | Faist Emmenegger M., Reinhard J., Zah R. (2009). Sustainability Quick Check for Biofuels - intermediate background report. With contributions from T. Ziep, R. Weichbrodt, Prof. Dr. V. Wohlgemuth, FHTW Berlin and A. Roches, R. Freiermuth Knuchel, Dr. G. Gaillard, Agroscope Reckenholz-Tänikon. | IPCC (2006). 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Prepared by the National Greenhouse Gas Inventories Programme. Volume 4: Agriculture, forestry and other land use. | Freiermuth R. (2006). Modell zur Berechnung der Schwermetallflüsse in der Landwirtschaftlichen Ökobilanz. | Nemecek T., Bengoa X., Lansche J., Mouron P., Rossi V., Humbert S., Riedener E. (2015). World Food LCA Database. Methodological Guidelines for the Life Cycle Inventory of Agricultural Products. Version 3.0. | Prasuhn V. (2006). Erfassung der PO4-Austräge für die Ökobilanzierung - SALCA-Phosphor.
    [modeling_constants] => System model: Allocation, cut-off. Orchard lifetime: 30 years. Tree density: 256 trees/ha. Average yield: 13.8 t/ha.
