    [lci_method] => In accordance with ISO 14025:2006 and EN 15804:2012+A2:2019/AC:2021
    [ds_data_selection] => Cut-off criterion of 1% maximum for material and energy contributions.
    [ds_data_treatment] => Energy and material consumption have been allocated to the specific product based on the annual production of the panels.
