    [sources_text] => GENERAL PROGRAMME INSTRUCTIONS FOR THE INTERNATIONAL EPD® SYSTEM, VER 4.0 (2021-02-29); PCR 2019:14 version 1.2.5, 2022-11-01 'Construction products'; ΕΝ 15804:2012 + A2:2019; UNI EN ISO 14025:2010; UNI EN ISO 14040:2021; UNI EN ISO 14044:2021; UNI EN 16783:2017; c-PCR-005 Thermal Insulation products (EN 16783); Life Cycle Assessment Technical Report, October 2022 - Bureau Veritas Nexta Srl
    [modeling_constants] => Cut-off criterion of 1% maximum for the contributions of material and energy. The sum of excluded material inputs does not exceed 1% of the total material inputs. Energy and material consumption allocated based on annual production.
